          "(refactor|restructure|reorganize|clean up|simplify).*?(this|the|module|file|class|function)",
          "(too (complex|long|coupled)|hard to (test|read|change))",
          "(should this|is this|what.?s wrong with).*?(design|architecture|pattern|approach)"
